<title>FRANCE: RALLYING-TOUR OF CORSICA LEADING PLACINGS.</title>
<headline>RALLYING-TOUR OF CORSICA LEADING PLACINGS.</headline>
<dateline>AJACCIO, Corsica 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading placings in the</p>
<p>Tour of Corsica world championship rally after seven timed</p>
